        },
        {
          "text": " Ekibi kya Yuda kihandiikirwe n'ekaraamu y'ekyoma, n'akabaare k'arimaasi akashongoize; kyasharurwa aha kishate ky'omutima gwabo n'aha mahembe g'amatambiro gaabo, ",
