            "sid": "JER 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oku nikwo MUKAMA yangambiire naagira ati: Irooko oyemerere omu irembo rya Benyamiini, ahu abagabe ba Yuda bataahira n'ahu bashohorera, n'omu marembo goona aga Yerusaalemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obagire oti: Imwe bagabe ba Yuda 'mwe, na Yuda yoona, n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu mwena abaraba omuri aga marembo, nimuhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.3.15+NEH.3.16+NEH.3.17+NEH.3.18+NEH.3.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 3:15-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Mwerinde, muteekorera omutwaro gwona aha izooba rya sabato, n'obu kwakuba okugurabya omu marembo ga Yerusaalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
